1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:05,177
It is picnic day! Look what is in the basket.

2
00:00:05,988 --> 00:00:09,686
Two apples and some bread. Yum, yum!

3
00:00:10,530 --> 00:00:14,300
Look at the sky. Those clouds are getting dark.

4
00:00:15,113 --> 00:00:19,234
Plip, plop. Raindrops start to fall!

5
00:00:20,072 --> 00:00:23,076
Oh no! Our picnic will get wet.

6
00:00:24,605 --> 00:00:27,240
Come under my big umbrella, friends!

7
00:00:28,072 --> 00:00:32,278
Three friends, one umbrella. Squeeze in close!

8
00:00:33,113 --> 00:00:36,600
We can have our picnic right here, together.

9
00:00:37,405 --> 00:00:42,711
The rain stops. The sun comes out. Look, a rainbow!

10
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:45,777
Sunlight and rain made a rainbow!

11
00:00:46,613 --> 00:00:50,226
A rainy day can still be a happy day with friends.

12
00:00:51,072 --> 00:00:53,728
What do you like to do on rainy days?
